@BlogApi_HostAddress = https://localhost:7226

### REGISTER
POST {{BlogApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "mert",
  "email": "mert@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}

### LOGIN
POST {{BlogApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "mert@test.com",
  "password": "123456"
}
### TOKEN OLMADAN TEST
GET {{BlogApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/test

### TOKEN ILE TEST
GET {{BlogApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/test
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..V3V96LBaMJdADEdCehXzukIstzkPFC89kT5qBAEL3N0

### ADMIN TEST
GET {{BlogApi_HostAddress}}/api/auth/admin-test
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..V3V96LBaMJdADEdCehXzukIstzkPFC89kT5qBAEL3N0

### BLOG EKLE
POST {{BlogApi_HostAddress}}/api/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer BURAYA_YENI_ADMIN_TOKEN

{
  "title": "İlk Blog Yazım",
  "content": "Bu benim ASP.NET Core ile oluşturduğum ilk blog yazısı.",
  "summary": "İlk blog yazısı"
}

### BLOG EKLE
POST {{BlogApi_HostAddress}}/api/post
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9..qnm9FDTI1IUUPrfMM4E8J9HWeBGZzLVhdzyF9UitVMw

